    <briefdescription>
<para>Produces a dense embedding vector from a text snippet. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations include:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>ONNX-CLIP sentence encoder (when THEMIS_ENABLE_ONNX_CLIP is ON)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>multilingual-E5 via llama.cpp embeddings API</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_null_embedding_backend" kindref="compound">NullEmbeddingBackend</ref> (zero-vector stub, <ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_i_embedding_backend_1a9f4676d5dd4acbc5d2b15d7e16496dfe" kindref="member">isAvailable()</ref> == false)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Thread safety: implementations MUST be thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
